From 8a1c222675b6e6308e4ed4292cd482391cc2f577 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Harmen Stoppels <harmen@stoppels.ch>
Date: Sun, 31 May 2026 09:56:34 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 14/21] Drop arch-specific files that require gcc inline-asm
 operands

- arch/aarch64/bits/alltypes.h.in: share __va_list_struct tag so
  va_list and __isoc_va_list are the same type (tcc rejects casting
  between identical-shape anonymous structs).
- src/math/aarch64: remove all asm shims; generic C math takes over.
